function qbrElDiagram(variant, o){ variant=variant||'process'; var defs={process:[{label:'Discover'},{label:'Define'},{label:'Design'},{label:'Deliver'}],cycle:[{label:'Plan'},{label:'Do'},{label:'Check'},{label:'Act'}],pyramid:[{label:'Vision'},{label:'Strategy'},{label:'Execution'},{label:'Foundation'}],hierarchy:[{label:'Owner'},{label:'Region A'},{label:'Region B'},{label:'Region C'}]}; return Object.assign({id:qbrUid(), type:'diagram', variant:variant, x:0.08,y:0.30,w:0.84,h:0.42, items:(defs[variant]||defs.process).map(function(d){return {label:d.label, sub:''};})}, o||{}); }
function qbrElStatRow(o){ return Object.assign({id:qbrUid(), type:'statrow', x:0.06,y:0.46,w:0.88,h:0.2, valueSize:32, items:[{value:'\u2212$1.59M',label:'YTD sales vs plan',sub:'8 months booked',tone:'negative'},{value:'+8.9%',label:'Q4 over-plan for +2%',sub:'',tone:'target'},{value:'85%',label:'of miss in 4 districts',sub:'',tone:'neutral'}]}, o||{}); }
function qbrElTitleBlock(o){ return Object.assign({id:qbrUid(), type:'titleblock', x:0.06,y:0.06,w:0.88,h:0.17, kicker:'SECTION', title:'Slide title', titleSize:34, kickerColor:'accent'}, o||{}); }
function qbrElPlaceholder(o){ return Object.assign({id:qbrUid(), type:'placeholder', x:0.08,y:0.26,w:0.84,h:0.6}, o||{}); }
function qbrFillPlaceholder(el, kind){
const slide=qbrActiveSlide(); if(!slide||!el) return;
qbrSnapshot();
const geo={x:el.x,y:el.y,w:el.w,h:el.h};
let nu;
if(kind==='chart') nu=qbrElChart();
else if(kind==='table') nu=qbrElTable();
else if(kind==='image') nu=qbrElImage();
else if(kind==='text') nu=qbrElText({text:'',size:18});
else if(kind==='kpi') nu=qbrElKpi();
else return;
Object.assign(nu, geo); nu.id=el.id; // keep id so selection + position carry over
const idx=slide.elements.indexOf(el);
if(idx>=0) slide.elements[idx]=nu; else slide.elements.push(nu);
QBR_STATE.selEl=nu.id; QBR_STATE.selEls=[nu.id]; QBR_STATE.editingEl=null;
qbrRenderCanvas(); qbrRenderInspector();
if(kind==='image') qbrPickImage(nu);
else if(kind==='text') qbrEnterTextEdit(nu.id);
else if(kind==='chart' && typeof qbrOpenInBuilder==='function') qbrOpenInBuilder(nu);
}
